Pe dată de 2011-08-03 03:57, Janis Papanagnou a scris:
> On 03.08.2011 02:07, The Barbarian wrote:
>> Is it possible to create macros for use in-game?  For example, I want
>> one that does n 2 0 s, searching twenty times.
> There are no in-game macros. But if you want n20s 20 times, why are you
> not just typing n400s ?
I guess that the idea is actually saving keystrokes – i.e. typing a
single key instead of four keys for searching 20 times by mapping it to
n20s.

I don't know of any way to do that in Vanilla, but there surely are
extensions for it.  Farmers…?

